{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24645","headline":"病中看经赠诸道侣 · 白居易","name":"病中看经赠诸道侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"右眼昏花左足风，金箆石水用无功。\n不如回念三乘乐，便得浮生百病空。\n无子同居草庵下，有妻偕老道塲中。\n何烦更请僧爲侣，月上新归伴病翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}